OL,3,GNEWSASir Elton John: 'Babydoll song had
OL,4,Ame leaping around the kitchen'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Elton John said he was "leaping
OL,7,Faround the kitchen" when he first heard
OL,8,FJamie Miller's history-making single,
OL,9,FBabydoll.
OL,11,FMiller, from Pontprennau in Cardiff,
OL,12,Fbecame the first Welsh artist to top
OL,13,Fthe UK singles chart in 15 years on 23
OL,14,FOctober with his viral TikTok hit,
OL,15,FBabydoll - and the single has stayed
OL,16,Fthere ever since, holding the top spot
OL,17,Ffor over a fortnight.
OL,19,FSpeaking on Sir Elton's Rocket Hour
OL,20,Fpodcast, the Rocket Man singer told
OL,21,FMiller he has a "huge future".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
