OL,3,GNEWSASir Elton John: 'Babydoll song had
OL,4,Ame leaping around the kitchen'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Elton said: "As soon as I heard it
OL,7,F[Babydoll] I was leaping around the
OL,8,Fkitchen. You really deserve the success
OL,9,Fbecause you sing like an angel. You
OL,10,Fhave a huge future in front of you."
